---
title: "Decimal to Fraction Converter — Coding.Tools"
description: "Convert decimal numbers to fractions instantly in your browser. Fast, private, and free to use."
toolTitle: "Decimal to Fraction"
toolDescription: "Enter a decimal number and convert it to a fraction (integer, numerator, denominator). Results appear instantly in your browser."
